  "description": "Discontinued, superseded by Gen3. This page is kept as an archive record for owners and for anyone researching an older Cotic Rocket.\n\nYears of production: 2015-2017\n\nThis is the Rocket Gen2, the first Rocket on 27.5\" wheels. The original 26\" bike is on the Rocket 26 (Gen1) page, and the other generations are in the Rocket archive.\n\nIt was a race proven Enduro weapon, which the Cotic Racing team took to multiple UK Gravity Enduro podiums in 2013, 2014 and 2015, to the PMBA Enduro Series overall championship titles in 2016 and 2017, and also campaigned in the Enduro World Series.\n\nFinishes: Matte Bright Orange and Matte Bright Green.",
